cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use λWAVES in a talk, a lesson or a paper, please cite it as below."
title: "λWAVES — a real-time WebGPU instrument for the hydrogen eigenstates"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hosain
    given-names: Joshua
    affiliation: Magic Commons
version: 0.1.0-alpha
date-released: 2026-09-11
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: https://github.com/magic-commons/lambdawaves
url: https://lambdawaves.magic-commons.com
abstract: >-
  λWAVES reconstructs the 91 exact hydrogen eigenstates with n ≤ 6 on the GPU as a playable wave
  field: amplitudes, phases, couplings and observers assemble into an evolving quantum field,
  with a modulation rack, projects and shareable state links. Built with AI coding agents under
  the author's direction; see the README's disclosure.
keywords:
  - hydrogen
  - quantum mechanics
  - WebGPU
  - visualisation
  - scientific instrument
